  "lyrics": [
    {
      "text": "When I find myself in times of trouble, Mother Mary comes to me",
      "start_time": 12.86,
      "end_time": 19.642
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 19.642,
      "end_time": 25.801
    },
    {
      "text": "And in my hour of darkness, she is standing right in front of me",
      "start_time": 25.801,
      "end_time": 32.181
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 32.181,
      "end_time": 37.901
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it be, let it be, let it be, let it be",
      "start_time": 37.901,
      "end_time": 45.561
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisper words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 45.561,
      "end_time": 51.781
    },
    {
      "text": "And when the broken hearted people living in the world agree",
      "start_time": 51.781,
      "end_time": 58.422
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an answer, let it be",
      "start_time": 58.422,
      "end_time": 64.782
    },
    {
      "text": "For though they may be parted, there is still a chance that they will see",
      "start_time": 64.782,
      "end_time": 71.662
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an answer, let it be",
      "start_time": 71.662,
      "end_time": 77.607
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it be, let it be, let it be, let it be",
      "start_time": 77.607,
      "end_time": 85.202
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an answer, let it be",
      "start_time": 85.202,
      "end_time": 90.981
    },
    {
